## Arbitrage System Principles

- Prioritize accuracy and synchronization of local orderbooks
- Respect API constraints and batch logic based on stream limits
- Use event-driven design for arbitrage signal generation
- Always apply slippage, fees, and latency penalties before flagging opportunities
- Monitor trades with watchdogs and kill-switches
- Maintain observability and post-trade analytics: log lifecycle of trades and failed signals to support tuning and auditability 
